AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"y-g8sgT7WkN16BBe9Vj41g","review_id":"bfLiNydXKYc6J2ppkrP9vA","date":"2019-08-18T22:36:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9567487239837646,"text_excerpt":"Popeyes? Who is that? Y'all I finally got to try Gus's fried chicken and I can see why it's world famous. I wanted to go when I was in Atlanta, but didn't have the time so thankfully it made its way around to NOLA! When you walk in you're greeted by smiling faces and you seat yourself where you like. A server will come to your table to take your order. I went today (Sunday afternoon around 3) and it was raining. We luckily got a spot right in front and it wasn't too packed inside. For starters, my friend and I got fried green tomatoes and fried pickle spears. They came out piping hot, enough to burn your tongue if you aren't careful. The pickles were nice and crunchy in a light batter and..."},{"business_id":"y-g8sgT7WkN16BBe9Vj41g","review_id":"IDIky-Ma09epZRYy-pnBWg","date":"2019-07-18T11:02:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9448224306106567,"text_excerpt":"We finally have a Gus's in Nola!! Bless da lords bc you know we love some good fried chicken here! Their crispy, hot and juicy fried chicken are fried in good ol' peanut oil. Fresh and made to order, I thought everything was delicious. It may need a bit more seasoning but only bc in Nola we like it that way! Hehe i thought it was fine with some hot sauce and ketchup. Other than that I thought the Mac and cheese could be a bit more cheesy with more sauce. Fried okra was tasty, great portions and great service. I loved the ambiance, it gave off an old school diner vibe. Very clean and kid friendly as well! Go and check it out friends bc I highly recommend."},{"business_id":"y-g8sgT7WkN16BBe9Vj41g","review_id":"Ckv_FyTKT4J87lRIJUxhgg","date":"2019-09-08T22:47:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9396753311157227,"text_excerpt":"I'm so happy to have a Gus's here in my home town. Yes, there are other wonderful fried chicken places in the city that are to be beat but Gus's gives me a quick fix without the full dining service experience that I always want - meaning I don't have to wait nearly as long for amazing chicken. My first experience with Gus's was in Forth Worth, TX, and the experience here in NOLA is just the same wonderful food. I've been about 3 times since opening, and I continue to rave about it to my peers. Their chicken has amazing flavor and spice to give you a kick without knocking you out. They are cooked to order, and this makes them super juicy and moist. I love the different combinations you can..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"y-g8sgT7WkN16BBe9Vj41g","photo_id":"TG8zENtuxzJWqpikJKhVGQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TG8zENtuxzJWqpikJKhVGQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8715603947639465},{"business_id":"y-g8sgT7WkN16BBe9Vj41g","photo_id":"eU4SiSPEOAFGe5x1-G7jRQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/eU4SiSPEOAFGe5x1-G7jRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8579665422439575},{"business_id":"y-g8sgT7WkN16BBe9Vj41g","photo_id":"woHBhFtUxeSkz23x14aF7A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/woHBhFtUxeSkz23x14aF7A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0